course: dictionary
lesson: 4200
title: Short names and abbreviations
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: An abbreviation is a short form of a longer name or word. Its letters stand for the longer words. GOP is an abbreviation. It stands for «Grand Old Party», and you will almost always see it written in capital letters, as GOP.
explain: The sentence «The two main US parties are the Democrats and the Republicans (also called the GOP)» gives you the clue. The words «also called» tell you that GOP is another name for the Republicans. Both names point to the same party.
explain: In news headlines, GOP is used a lot, as in «GOP candidates» or «the GOP majority in the Senate». When you see a short form you do not know, look for the longer name nearby in the text, or check a dictionary.
fact: GOP is short for «Grand Old Party».
fact: The GOP is a nickname for the Republican Party, one of the two main political parties in the United States.
fact: The other main US party is the Democratic Party, also called the Democrats.
fact: The GOP's symbol is an elephant, and the Democrats' symbol is a donkey.
fact: GOP is not an ordinary English word on its own. It is written in capitals, so look for it in news and politics texts.
exercise: «The two main US parties are the Democrats and the Republicans (also called the GOP).» What does GOP stand for? | General Office of Parliament | Global Oil Partnership | Great Old Politicians | *Grand Old Party
exercise: In this sentence, what is the GOP? | Another name for the Democratic Party | A country in Europe | A type of donkey | *Another name for the Republican Party
exercise: Which animal is the symbol of the GOP? | *An elephant | A donkey | A wolf | A lion
test: In the headline «GOP candidates», what does GOP mean? | A news channel | The Democratic Party | *The Republican Party | A kind of election
test: Which party is the main rival of the GOP in the United States? | The Liberal Club | The Greens | *The Democrats | The Scottish party
exam: Why is GOP written in capital letters in the news? | It means very old in every text | It is a Scottish word | It is a donkey symbol, so it must be capitals | *It is an abbreviation, short for Grand Old Party
